\eqn{x_{i,1}\leq\cdots\leq x_{i,m}} be the sorted ensemble members and
\eqn{p_j=j/m}. For interior bins \eqn{j=1,\ldots,m-1}, define
\deqn{\alpha_{i,j}=\max\{0,\min(obs_i,x_{i,j+1})-x_{i,j}\},
